    "transformation_rules": "Scale coordinates/lengths by s, areas by s^2, volumes by s^3 and central volume moments by s^5. Translate centroids but not central moments. Permute image labels and all vector/tensor axes; reverse polygon winding for an odd coordinate permutation to preserve outward normals.",
